\frametitle{Pedagogical quality constraints}
The same graph is educationally meaningful only in a narrower sense: it
approximates a knowledge-space style closure condition over authored
skills, where later tasks should not be treated as feasible before their
prerequisites, but it does not infer an individual learner's latent
knowledge state (Doignon and Falmagne 1985; Falmagne and Doignon 2011).
